Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不...不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別發出奇怪的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身體真夠僵硬的啊 溝口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但頭腦和精神很柔韌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.82,0:00:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得一樣僵硬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.49,0:00:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但錢包和貞操堅不可摧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼冒出貞操來了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（我對男子啦啦隊很感興趣）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.17,0:00:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有第四個人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:51.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,COME ON——! !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:15.07,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}結束漫不經心度過的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.19,0:01:19.07,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}滿心想要脫離現狀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:24.70,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我總是不敢踏出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:28.87,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}每次是你牽著我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:34.71,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}帶我去看新的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:37.05,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}世界變幻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:39.13,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}邁出最初一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:42.38,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}仿佛帶來了變化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.55,0:01:48.31,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不再擔心 我們在一起能去到任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:49.85,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}去吧 飛翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:51.44,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}以最本真的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.56,0:01:54.65,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}雖也有不安也有迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.77,0:02:01.32,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但有太多事情 不試試沒法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:02.82,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}去吧 飛翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:07.83,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}伸手仿佛能觸碰天空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.95,0:02:10.96,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我們不再孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:16.09,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}投身新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:15.07,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}何気なく過ごしてる　日々に蓋してしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.19,0:01:19.07,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}抜け出したい気持ちは山々です
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:24.70,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}初めの一歩目が　踏み出せない僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:28.87,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}いつでも君が僕の手引っ張って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:34.71,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}新しいモノを見に　連れて行ってくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:37.05,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}世界が変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:39.13,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}初めの一歩目で
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:42.38,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}変われた気がした
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.55,0:01:48.31,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}とこまでても行ける　もう大丈夫僕らなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:49.85,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:51.44,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}ありのままで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.56,0:01:54.65,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不安も迷いもあるけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.77,0:02:01.32,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}やってみなきゃわからない　事がたくさんあるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:02.82,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:07.83,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}あのそらに届きそうなぐらいに手を伸ばす
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.95,0:02:10.96,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}僕らはもう一人じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:16.09,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}新しい世界に飛び込むのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是學生嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.45,0:02:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要說起來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:47.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通疑問句最後都會加個「嗎」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.33,0:02:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就和日語一樣 會在句末的「です」後面加個「か」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:50.40,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,第四個人怎麼樣了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用「ですか」來構成疑問句
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:56.38,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,約好了去向日葵食堂面談
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咋回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.76,0:03:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蟲 蟲爬到我胳膊上了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多謝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.37,0:03:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我第一次來這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.29,0:03:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作為命志院的學生 總來過一兩次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家是開{\u1}料亭{\u0}的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:33.54,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,注：料亭：高級的傳統日本料理餐廳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家裡人叫我別進這種便宜的店
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.21,0:03:37.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,店長 豬排咖喱還沒好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要吃這個？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.31,0:03:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請幫我加油啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼開始
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.35,0:03:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我開吃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:03:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20分鐘之內吃完就免費
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.45,0:04:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,申請入部的就是這人？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.49,0:04:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說這名字我好像在哪看過
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:12.30,左上记,NTP,0,0,0,,遠野：我對男子啦啦隊很感興趣\N阿一：十分感謝！具體事情的話，\N明天午飯時在向日葵食堂談怎麼樣？\N遠野：明白了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久沒見
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.76,0:04:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的記錄還沒被破呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遠野浩司
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨大豬排咖喱最短紀錄保持者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.81,0:04:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還以為是柔道部的歷代主將呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我高中時的照片 太不好意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是男子啦啦隊的成員嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是橋本一馬 這是阪東晴希
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們都是社會學部一年級的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.37,0:04:48.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,溝口涉 商學部一年級
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:51.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是文學部的一年級學生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 不知方不方便...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行 有問題隨便問
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 我想點餐...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:05:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請給我一份豬排咖喱烏冬飯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.97,0:05:05.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個是秘密功能表上的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:11.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒吃完 哎 真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.23,0:05:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咋回事 咋就走了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還差1400日元
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多謝惠顧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.57,0:05:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到傳單就給我發郵件了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那阿遠你...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.99,0:05:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿遠？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫遠野所以簡稱阿遠啊 還能是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:35.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別亂給人起綽號
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:35.37,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,注：「阿遠」的日語發音「トン」(ton)和「豚」(豬) 相同
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不也是互相稱呼阿晴阿一的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:42.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不介意的話也可以叫我阿溝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.59,0:05:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那阿遠你現在體重多少
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼突然問這個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:53.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 大約100公斤...吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:55.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有沒有參加過什麼運動？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.94,0:05:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 你不用道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不同體型在啦啦隊裡都有合適的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:07.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過...為什麼選擇進啦啦隊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想改變
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:15.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Today is the first day of the rest of the your life
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是你餘生的第一天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,電影《美國麗人》中的一句台司
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:32.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這句話真經典
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.02,0:06:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 你剛說不同體型在啦啦隊裡都有合適的位置...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.41,0:06:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來解釋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:55.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個在最高處舉起雙手的人是{\u1}尖子{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:55.95,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1368,930)}top
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:59.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺就像是最耀眼的明星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為需要做跳躍動作 所以多由小個子擔任
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.71,0:07:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱們之中的話 我和阿晴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抬著尖子的是{\u1}底座{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:09.09,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1148.571,930)}base
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要用肩膀扛起尖子 或是雙手把人托舉起來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個位置適合體格健壯的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:16.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿遠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在後面扶著的是{\u1}後點{\u0} 作用是輔助底座
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:23.15,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(953.143,930)}spot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.27,0:07:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是支撐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如托舉尖子的時機等等 都得由後點來指揮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.11,0:07:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好比指揮台
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我給每個人都燒錄了一份
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.45,0:07:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...隊員還不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,參加大賽需要16個人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼下的目標是召集7個人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:49.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後在十月學園祭上亮相
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.05,0:08:27.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.51,0:08:31.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的要退出柔道部？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為受了傷？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.31,0:08:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:41.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為成績不佳？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.31,0:08:46.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我反對 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要放棄柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.95,0:09:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成績這東西 多努力總能出的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...想去...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:12.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...尖子 底座 後點是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:37.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,記得我是適合尖子...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.74,0:09:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的要當這個？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:54.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家也都試試
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:57.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我能做到 能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:09:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,試試看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一個 阿遠
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.63,0:10:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:13.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.43,0:10:15.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三點倒立
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儘量學會只用雙手倒立吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一個 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走起來更容易保持平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 停得下來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒立還能練肌肉 鍛煉平衡感
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:39.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以每天都得記著練倒立
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及拉伸也要每天做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身體不夠柔韌的話容易受傷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對翻騰動作也有影響
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻...翻什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.63,0:10:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻騰 指後翻或者空翻之類
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴是尖子 到時候得練習翻騰的跳躍翻轉動作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.97,0:11:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關、關於這個我當尖子...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 你可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也會努力練倒立和拉伸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來練習喊口號
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟是應援嘛 要大聲些 精神著點
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帶著笑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那大家排好隊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.29,0:11:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我來 開始
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.38,0:11:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再笑燦爛些
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別不出聲啊 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 笑容 笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 確實很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不知我能不能學會倒立
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:12:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前沒運動過
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:03.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我這種人 不擅長在人前表現自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為阿一說想組建啦啦隊 我才跟著加入了進來而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是阿遠 你是為了改變自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才主動加入的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這真的很厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反騰！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是翻騰啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被巨大豬排咖喱打敗的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,網球同好會？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也會
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.79,0:12:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瓢蟲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可這和網球沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:12:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:12:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還好意思說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 去吃飯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:09.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:30.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家來乾杯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.37,0:13:32.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乾杯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:32.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乾杯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.39,0:13:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說你們是{\u1}社團難民{\u0}？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.39,0:13:47.60,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,注：社團難民：想進社團卻找不到可以加入的社團的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.85,0:13:47.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:50.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴順著他的話往下說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.94,0:13:53.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就是按這設定混進來的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也太土鰵了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.69,0:13:59.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進了我們社團 也不代表一定能找到女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 下次要不要去學校附近新開的義大利餐廳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼義大利餐廳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喝酒了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經滿二十了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是一年級嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浪人 不會把你做成{\u1}蠟人{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:17.13,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,注：浪人和蠟人音相同。\N蠟人：指未能一次考上大學後複讀再考的學生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不明白什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們可真有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.13,0:14:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是抖包袱又是吐槽的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你倆都是關西人？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我東京出身
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逗我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,順帶一提我叫總一郎 大家都叫我一郎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這小子是弦 我們是商學部一年級的人氣組合
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.65,0:14:41.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪來的人氣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎 這裡不該笑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才看你的後翻很漂亮 以前參加過什麼運動嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直是棒球部的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:51.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是足球部的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:55.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙醉了 沒救了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒醉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:15:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棒球部和足球部啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼現在進網球部了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.59,0:15:06.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為一直是搞體育的 身邊全是漢子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以想進大學之後找個時髦點的社團
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就你這腦袋還好意思說時髦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...不覺得眼下不太符合你們的想法嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來我們這兒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們那兒？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:31.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男子啦啦隊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不是社團難民嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們來這裡 是為了拉你們入隊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你們幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男子啦啦隊？啦啦隊是不是那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.39,0:15:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿著短裙一邊揮舞花球一邊跳舞的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是變態嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.40,0:16:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的 我們要加油呐喊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為那些拼了命地做某件事的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.78,0:16:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為那些執著的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.45,0:16:08.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就和傳單上寫的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:12.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給他人的應援 將成為主角
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:16.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,助他人一臂之力 也會鼓舞自己
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.29,0:16:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任務完成 回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:25.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼 竟然有臉混進別人的社團挖牆角
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成了 雙手刈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.90,0:16:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你練過柔道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阪東好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.74,0:16:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我阿晴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴一
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.87,0:16:59.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎 這誰的名字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他倆肯定會聯繫咱們的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:06.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪來的自信
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看見他的毛巾了沒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.05,0:17:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們那樣的人 就喜歡跟人紮堆一起做一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:20.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還差一點...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.20,0:17:35.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不啊 很厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有天賦 阿遠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比不過你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你練得真努力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡是一點點
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.59,0:17:48.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說那倆人有消息嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:50.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 還沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.18,0:17:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未必不行阿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.47,0:18:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 我也努力了一下下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.52,0:18:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畫得好爛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.19,0:18:07.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒說這個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.69,0:18:11.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是想稍稍地宣傳一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,召集部員
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...然後是高V來著？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 笑得開點 手抬高 看前面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的動作好僵硬
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:43.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要面帶笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 正練著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:53.00,左上记,,0,0,0,,阿一：練習的視頻已經發過去了，看看吧\N阿晴：喔，謝謝。過會兒會看的。\N阿一：那麼明天大學見。宣傳表演加油哦！！\N阿晴：...瞭解。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我當然 知道你只要決定了一件事就會拼了命去做
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:11.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:17.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.44,0:19:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.15,0:19:29.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.61,0:19:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告辭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還以為大清早沒人經過呢 丟人...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要...要在這裡演嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太顯眼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.09,0:19:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不顯眼還有什麼意義
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:53.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.09,0:20:00.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位命志院大學的同學
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面是我們男子啦啦隊的宣傳表演
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊那位想做些新鮮事的男生！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊那位想做些好玩的事的男生！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要和我們一起竭盡全力為別人應援呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.87,0:20:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.63,0:20:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.43,0:20:40.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.35,0:20:42.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.90,0:20:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼 街頭雜耍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.94,0:20:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼社團
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:20:57.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:20:59.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.12,0:21:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那幾個男生幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說是啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:09.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男生的啦啦隊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:10.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:19.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.85,0:21:34.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.73,0:21:38.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,WE ARE CHEER BOYS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.70,0:21:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男子啦啦隊 絕贊部員募集中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.33,0:21:52.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不出所料地入部了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.25,0:21:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本沒料到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就想做些有新意又有意思的事 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.67,0:22:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倆加入了 啦啦隊可得更熱鬧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:02.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下就有六個人了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.14,0:22:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 在學園祭就差一個了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還差一個
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.77,0:22:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們幾個剛才表演來著
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表演什麼 啦啦隊是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他倆只是為了出風頭勾搭妹子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:31.90,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(895.5,805.071)}{\c&HD59FE5&}最初的應援笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:31.90,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(917.785,787.929)}{\c&HE4DB75&}最初的應援笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:31.90,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(943.5,772.5)}最初的應援笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:33.29,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.62,0:22:34.96,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.38,0:22:36.59,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,JUST DO IT！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.67,0:22:39.30,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:45.01,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,不由自主地大聲回應
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:48.60,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,嶄新大門打開的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:51.64,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,就像緊緊握住的拳頭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.81,0:22:55.02,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,決意堅定地響起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.31,0:22:58.44,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,想要散發的能量 一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.57,0:23:01.82,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,說實話感覺能改變些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.90,0:23:04.74,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,你總是在尋找
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.82,0:23:08.12,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的事情對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.37,0:23:11.62,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有自信＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.66,0:23:14.83,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,自暴自棄＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:16.71,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,那天的自己 不要輸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.83,0:23:18.34,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,送上應援的呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:22.92,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,加油打氣的動作＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.09,0:23:26.30,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE 起飛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.43,0:23:29.93,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,垂頭喪氣抱怨「到極限了」＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:33.27,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT 打破極限＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:36.56,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向彼此微笑 流下汗水SHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.65,0:23:39.73,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向著晴空＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:43.07,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利的姿勢＜高V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.19,0:23:46.24,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,連同心一起抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.36,0:23:50.03,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向著邂逅閃耀笑容的瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.12,0:23:52.95,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.08,0:23:57.58,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:45.01,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,思わず大きな返事してたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:48.60,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,新しい扉ひらく声は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:51.64,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぎゅっと握ったこぶしみたいだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.81,0:22:55.02,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頼もしそうに響く決意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.31,0:22:58.44,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,弾けたいエネルギー　ずっと待ってたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.57,0:23:01.82,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぶっちゃけたら何かを　変えられる気がして
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.90,0:23:04.74,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おもしろそうなこといつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.82,0:23:08.12,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,探してきたんだろ？そうだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.37,0:23:11.62,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,自信なくて＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.66,0:23:14.83,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ふてくされてた＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:16.71,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの日の自分＜負けるな！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.83,0:23:18.34,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,エールを＜おくろう！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:22.92,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,元気づけるモーション＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.09,0:23:26.30,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE　とびだせ！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.43,0:23:29.93,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「もう限界」なんてうなだれは＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:33.27,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT　壊しちゃえばいい＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:36.56,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,笑いあって　汗をかいてSHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.65,0:23:39.73,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,青空へ＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:43.07,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利のポーズ＜HIGH V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.19,0:23:46.24,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,心ごと掴め！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.36,0:23:50.03,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,キラめく笑顔に出会える瞬間へ
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.67,0:24:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松鼠次郎？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.88,0:24:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,記得是廣告裡的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.63,0:24:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還挺喜歡的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.30,0:24:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松鼠體態輕盈 要是我也能像松鼠那樣該多好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.64,0:24:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想變成松鼠 我要成為松鼠之王
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.56,0:24:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下—集「第七人松鼠次郎」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.10,0:24:19.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN

Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.30,0:24:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
